 competency='Use the actual comfortable mid-range or higher supported stance, with controlled entry/exit and breathing at that depth. Preserve any smaller recent hold with the explicit cap. If entry is still unknown, P1 is quiet standing; S1 counts the first taught high-stance entries. Neither supported rise nor ordinary step-out proves the new diagonal exit.',
 progression='Keep support side/height, contact, stance depth and hold. Explicit 1/2/3-second ceilings apply to both P1 lead holds and S1; never lengthen a recent smaller hold because D is selected. The separate bilateral finish stays 2 s when eligible.',
