 progression='All ages use the explicit 5 s D / 3 s L reference per lead only if compatible with their actual recent hold. The 1/2/3 s ceilings preserve smaller history in either mode. Keep one combined set, support and depth. A capped P1/S1 route never adds holds elsewhere.',
